# App Chấm công — Walkthrough

## Tổng quan
Đã xây dựng hoàn chỉnh app **Chấm công** (Time & Attendance) cho TD Games platform.

---

## Database (Supabase — `fifuhkupaqcfjwyouwpa`)
5 bảng + 6 indexes:
- `att_shifts` — Ca làm việc (cố định, xoay, theo dự án)
- `att_employee_shifts` — Phân ca cho nhân viên
- `att_records` — Bản ghi chấm công (check-in/out, late detection)
- `att_requests` — Đơn từ (nghỉ phép, đi muộn, về sớm, quên chấm, tăng ca)
- `att_qr_sessions` — Phiên QR chấm công

## Files tạo mới

| File | Mô tả |
|---|---|
| [attendanceService.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/attendance/services/attendanceService.ts) | Service layer (CRUD + smart check-in/out) |
| [useAttendanceState.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/attendance/hooks/useAttendanceState.ts) | Central state hook |
| [AttendanceApp.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/attendance/components/AttendanceApp.tsx) | App shell + Navbar (5 tabs) |
| [Dashboard.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/attendance/components/Dashboard.tsx) | Stat cards + quick check-in |
| [ShiftManager.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/attendance/components/ShiftManager.tsx) | CRUD ca + phân ca |
| [AttendanceLog.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/attendance/components/AttendanceLog.tsx) | Records table |
| [RequestManager.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/attendance/components/RequestManager.tsx) | Đơn từ + approve/reject |
| [AttendanceReport.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/attendance/components/AttendanceReport.tsx) | Báo cáo tuần/tháng |

## Files sửa đổi
- [types.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/types.ts) — 5 interfaces mới
- [apps.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/config/apps.ts) — App registry
- [App.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/App.tsx) — Route handler

